⭐ Bonus Challenge — Create Your First Library
Create a file named:

utilities.py
It should contain:

is_even(n)
square(n)
cube(n)
Import it into another Python file and test all three functions.

Solution
utilities.py

def is_even(n):
    return n % 2 == 0

def square(n):
    return n ** 2

def cube(n):
    return n ** 3
test.py

import utilities

print(utilities.is_even(8))
print(utilities.square(5))
print(utilities.cube(3))
Example Output:

True
25
27
